        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  contents: [\n    {\n      parts: [\n        {\n          text: `You are scoring a sales signal against a law firm's Ideal Customer Profile. Score the signal as Hot, Warm, or Cold based on how well it matches the ICP criteria below.\n\nICP criteria (retrieved as most relevant to this signal):\n${$input.all().map(item => item.json.content).join('\\n\\n')}\n\nSignal to score:\nCompany: ${$('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.company_name}\nSignal: ${$('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.signal_description}\nSource: ${$('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.source_url}\nDate detected: ${$('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.date_detected}\n\nScore this signal Hot if it shows a strong, time-sensitive buying trigger clearly matching the ICP. Score Warm if it shows partial fit or a weaker trigger. Score Cold if it does not match the ICP criteria or shows an explicit disqualifier. Give your reasoning first, then state the score on its own line as exactly one of: Hot, Warm, Cold.`\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  generationConfig: {\n    temperature: 0.1,\n    thinkingConfig: {\n      thinkingBudget: 512\n    }\n  }\n}) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {}
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -208
      ],
      "id": "996d572f-bc2d-4a52-bfbe-3af7b6c4ab04",
      "name": "Score Signal Against ICP (Gemini)",
      "executeOnce": false,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "pythonNative",
        "pythonCode": "text = _items[0][\"json\"][\"candidates\"][0][\"content\"][\"parts\"][0][\"text\"]\n\nscore = \"Unknown\"\nlast_line = text.strip().split(\"\\n\")[-1]\nif \"Hot\" in last_line:\n    score = \"Hot\"\nelif \"Warm\" in last_line:\n    score = \"Warm\"\nelif \"Cold\" in last_line:\n    score = \"Cold\"\n\nreturn [{\n    \"json\": {\n        \"score\": score,\n        \"reasoning\": text\n    }\n}]"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
